   "b:0.1.2"},ExpressionUUID->"707e9fd5-9c11-42c8-aaaa-1cf5b3c6582b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["SuperLie",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " package provides a number of functions for manipulation with vector \
expressions, including\n\[Bullet] Evaluating and simplifying vector \
expressions;\n\[Bullet] Solving vector equations (with either scalar or \
vector unknowns);\n\[Bullet] Working with expressions with indefinite \
coefficients;\n\[Bullet] Preparing output in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"T", 
    AdjustmentBox["E",
     BoxBaselineShift->0.5,
     BoxMargins->{{-0.075, -0.085}, {0, 0}}], "X"}]]],ExpressionUUID->
  "211e585c-2c78-44fc-bd15-47c96b9efb03"],
 " format."
}], "Text",
 TextAlignment->Left,
 TextJustification->1,
 CellTags->"b:0.1.2",ExpressionUUID->"4345ab52-8d5c-4925-bf06-4b97a51ea4ff"],

