used in symbolic calculations, because any linear combination of \
vector-valued functions is also treated as a function: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"f", "+", 
      RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", " ", "g"}]}], ")"}], "[", "x", "]"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"f", "[", "x", "]"}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", " ", 
     RowBox[{"g", "[", "x", "]"}]}]}]}]],ExpressionUUID->
